file tools/fixtures/l/living_pin_near_bound_control.sh plants derived from the fixture, plus case 0 stating the pen's own precondition
file tools/l/living_pin_near_bound_witness.rish ten behaviors, the new assert, and the header saying why a ratio outlives an absolute
